# Always merge PRs

When this agent opens or updates a pull request for work that is ready (tests/CI green, fix or feature complete):

1. Mark the PR ready for review (not draft) if it was created as draft.
2. **Merge it into `main` before ending the turn** (`gh pr merge --merge` or equivalent). Do not leave merge to the user or the next chat.
3. Prefer merge (merge commit) unless the repo standard says otherwise.
4. After merge, confirm `mergedAt` is set on the PR.

This applies every session. Do not stop at "PR created" or "CI passed".
